OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening from the southwest through
OL,7,Fthe evening as rain and strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds soon spread northeast. Perhaps
OL,9,Fdrier later with winds easing later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain expected, along with
OL,14,Fstrengthening winds. However some
OL,15,Fdrier intervals are also likely.
OL,16,FStrongest winds are likely through the
OL,17,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
